import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 278 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Cultivation Resource Distribution: Resource Attachment Under the Bestowal System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 278 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Cultivation Resource Distribution: Resource Attachment Under the Bestowal System","no":278,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Cultivation Resources","Resource Distribution","Bestowal Attachment","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["18-Cultivation Resource Opening Mechanism","22-Joint Contracting Resource Distribution Mechanism","06-More-Work-More-Reward Distribution Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0278_模块2-唐罗-修炼资源分配.md","filePath":"en/0278_模块2-唐罗-修炼资源分配.md"}'),s={name:"en/0278_模块2-唐罗-修炼资源分配.md"};function r(a,e,l,u,c,h){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-278-tang-luo-decomposition-cultivation-resource-distribution-resource-attachment-under-the-bestowal-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 278 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Cultivation Resource Distribution: Resource Attachment Under the Bestowal System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-278-tang-luo-decomposition-cultivation-resource-distribution-resource-attachment-under-the-bestowal-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 278 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Cultivation Resource Distribution: Resource Attachment Under the Bestowal System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 28)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-whoever-holds-resources-holds-life" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Whoever holds resources holds life <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-whoever-holds-resources-holds-life" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Whoever holds resources holds life&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the anti-predation axiom requires developing increments, not consuming stock; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings to have equal evolution qualification. The Tang-Luo system&#39;s cultivation resource distribution is the bestowal system&#39;s core component — resources are given by Tang Luo, all beings live off Tang Luo. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Bestowal-system resource distribution&#39;s energy-level waste:</p><ul><li><strong>Rent-seeking cost</strong>: to get Tang Luo&#39;s resource allocation, all beings study &quot;how to please Tang Luo,&quot; not &quot;how to improve cultivation.&quot; Civilization&#39;s bright minds are massively consumed in rent-seeking</li><li><strong>Mismatch uncorrectable</strong>: resource distribution judged by Tang Luo alone, judgment bias unchecked. Truly talented but not social persons cannot get resources; social but mediocre-talented persons get them</li><li><strong>Stock thinking</strong>: Tang Luo distributes existing resources (stock), not developing increments. However fairly he divides the cake, the cake does not grow</li></ul><p>Energy-level waste: <strong>the entropy of resource distribution far exceeds the resources&#39; own value.</strong> Of ten thousand portions, maybe under 30% actually hits the blade.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Rent-seeking culture</strong>: because resources are bestowed by Tang Luo, cultivation circles form a &quot;stay near the power center&quot; culture. Geniuses do not frontier, they schmooze</li><li><strong>Increment stagnation</strong>: because no one is incentivized to develop new resources (once developed, must hand over to Tang Luo for distribution), civilization&#39;s total resource amount stagnates</li><li><strong>Attachment network</strong>: around Tang Luo forms a complex human-relations network, master-disciple network, faction network. These networks weave denser, finally trapping Tang Luo himself</li></ol><p>Regression form: resource distribution grows more complex, total resources shrink.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Distribution is sovereignty</strong>: whoever distributes resources is civilization&#39;s master. Tang Luo holding distribution right is holding all beings&#39; lives</li><li><strong>Attachment is chains</strong>: all beings, for resources, must attach to Tang Luo. Once attachment forms, the attached&#39;s personality, judgment, courage are all bound by chains</li><li><strong>Bestowal is taming</strong>: Tang Luo bestowing resources is essentially taming — making all beings used to &quot;waiting for reward,&quot; not &quot;going to earn&quot;</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo = <strong>enlightened predator</strong>, resource distribution right is his predation structure&#39;s hardest component.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tang-Luo Bestowed Distribution</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Distribution</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tang Luo gives resources</td><td>Joint contracting, more work more reward, distribute by contribution</td></tr><tr><td>Rent-seeking culture</td><td>Resource distribution transparent, distribution rules by law not by person</td></tr><tr><td>Mismatch uncorrectable</td><td>Alaya monitors distribution effects, mismatch auto-alerts</td></tr><tr><td>Stock thinking</td><td>Develop increments: Origin Three-Basic provides new resource growth points</td></tr><tr><td>Attachment network</td><td>Resource attribution clear, attached to no one</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: change &quot;Tang Luo bestows&quot; to &quot;institutions distribute.&quot; Distribution&#39;s subject changes from person to law.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Tang-Luo bestowed distribution model</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A bestowal; Group B joint contracting</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: total resources within a hundred years, rent-seeking cost proportion</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group B total resources ten times Group A, rent-seeking cost approaches zero</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-high</strong>. Strong ones distributing resources is web-novel convention</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Long-form late if it needs new resources, the cheapest move is &quot;Tang Luo discovers a new vein&quot; — resource stock stretches with plot</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: high</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: rent-seeking cost and mismatch cost eat up most resources</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: distribution right is sovereignty, bestowal is taming</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo divides stock; Heng Yuan Zhou makes increments</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: distribution rules transparent, 99% not oppressed by 9%</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: increment thinking can support cross-plane resource development</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-deconstructing-resource-attachment" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: Deconstructing Resource Attachment <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-deconstructing-resource-attachment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: Deconstructing Resource Attachment&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Tang-Luo system&#39;s cultivation resource distribution attachment logic&#39;s core is resources held by the bestower, recipients must attach. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s alternative is joint contracting and increment development: resources are no longer fixed stock, but increments that cultivators continuously create through civilization engineering. The Alaya Network real-time settles each cultivator&#39;s resource output and consumption; the law-first axiom ensures distribution is by contribution, not by personal connection. Under the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, the universal equal infinite law makes resource attachment fundamentally meaningless — since origin is infinite, why attach?</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The subject of resource distribution determines civilization&#39;s shape. The Tang-Luo system&#39;s subject is &quot;Tang Luo&quot;; the Heng Yuan Zhou system&#39;s subject is &quot;law.&quot; From &quot;Tang Luo distributes&quot; to &quot;law distributes,&quot; the difference is not resources, but civilization&#39;s adulthood.</p><p>In the final analysis, Tang-Luo · cultivation resource distribution described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./18-修炼资源开放机制.html">18-Cultivation Resource Opening Mechanism</a> · <a href="./22-资源分配联产承包机制.html">22-Joint Contracting Resource Distribution Mechanism</a> · <a href="./06-多劳多得分配原理.html">06-More-Work-More-Reward Distribution Principle</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const m=t(s,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
